        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Overview</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hi there, everyone, do you like horror games?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I think a lot of people aren't into them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They have that creepy atmosphere and sudden scares.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But the stories are often intriguing. Even if you're curious enough to want to play, the fear usually wins out, and you end up not being able to.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >That happens, right?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is designed with &quot;maximum&quot; consideration for people who are not good at horror games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Various designs have been used to make the scary elements of horror games less frightening.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, since it is a horror game, there may be some elements that are a little scary.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We aimed to create a game that is “seems scary but isn't, but still a little scary...”</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is especially recommended for people who are not good at horror games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I’m sure that after completing it, you’ll feel like you’ve truly conquered a horror game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It should take around 30 minutes to an hour to reach the normal ending, and around 2 to 3 hours to reach the true ending.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a top-down adventure game with no need for quick or detailed controls. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It includes a few puzzle elements. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are three main endings in this multi-ending game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In search of his childhood friend Hiroi, who wandered into a deserted factory with a dark history while chasing his pet cat, the protagonist Kino arrives at the factory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There, strange things happen... well, not many, but a few...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will Kino be able to rescue Hiroi and return home safely?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Age restriction</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is a small amount of blood.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Horror elements have been minimized with the maximum consideration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Stuff</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&lt;Story, Programming&gt;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ryuhan</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&lt;Character Design, Graphics&gt;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chisato</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&lt;Character walking graphics&gt;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uomine mko</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&lt;Extra and true ending BGM&gt;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Munaka Kota</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&lt;Debugging, English translation assistance&gt;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nagatani Riryo</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Copyright</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&lt;Game Engine&gt;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >RPG Maker MZ</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(C)Gotcha Gotcha Games Inc./YOJI OJIMA 2020</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >​</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&lt;Background Tile Set&gt;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >KR Urban Decay Tileset</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >KR Urban Decay Interior Tileset</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >KR Factory Tileset</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >KR Mad Science Lab Tileset</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >KR Modern Hospital Tileset</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(C)Kokoro Reflections</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CreepyLand Tileset Pack</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(C)Shigekichi</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Japanese-Style Tile Set</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(C)com-sho</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >RPG Maker MV</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(C)Gotcha Gotcha Games Inc./YOJI OJIMA 2015</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&lt;Music&gt;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Suspense Music Library Vol.1</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mystery Music Library Vol.1</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(C)TK.Projects</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >​</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Karugamo BGM Vol.5</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(C)tobi</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >​</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&lt;plug-in&gt;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >triacontane</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >panda</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ru-tan</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >woodpenguin</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >maguros</p>",
